{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7763a74bf6cb14fe1c95c9c3a2ad5502fac660a2e5c8ea36ce9735133129ee40",
      "source_sha256": "21872fbea5e437fc8f37bae69a1e4d186cc388174b2cf3a07da37e6d5b2fef32",
      "translation": "那么，准备好就出发去老狐峡谷吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:db0650d1e97285d73d0aea5ca516ed1c771693de01bcda8d191e7e149d7cb440",
      "source_sha256": "81676412f15fa1c2c50e3dcc7fa3f436488f0163861be45ea7ff12018ad16663",
      "translation": "说起来，出发前最好先“强化”一下武器。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:add7d75660f5d421adac30260565d0321eed6ab9aca8426de941847028023105",
      "source_sha256": "7f556c00abad922d2ce78869f9c053374ce8c2d79b61f515ae25cd40dca3d642",
      "translation": "强化？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9851b429f205448ecd2ff9dae3b6083f7c52995888dc3ed52dd0132bbca07ea9",
      "source_sha256": "b38f47e4951b129a60cb14ab9647d8a33080e7994bb8561fddd659166f333139",
      "translation": "朱特，你知道强化是怎么回事吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d08b94620d927a310ba7be9c6f35a9fd8fa71d5227e59d5226c26229eeb3ff7b",
      "source_sha256": "8b298d521a3f17c58e874094494748d1399df4fd2b022b17419be5b72f3e8e79",
      "translation": "嗯，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c6a88043752f60592da3bb99e52975238a9a999e2024d35dc34ff7106fe19468",
      "source_sha256": "deab42b37d277ad8d088bcbed0aa0e20c5702d6d9d789628c66f1f990633d50c",
      "translation": "是吗？不过，以防万一，我还是通过库布把强化说明发给你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6db924d429cff24af1d1646bf1e1bcc47a6869cb7c712edad24a04b463abff56",
      "source_sha256": "5a4ed6494232d4f89443eeb14c979c00e867a294427515f9899354dc16c9db08",
      "translation": "那我来简单说明一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3ce89a3d08ab2cc748f39293de497efb13e3118a93be6b4cdd7eea50524b549c",
      "source_sha256": "4417ec307f24ff39cc31fd1149604b5e13026da52d34fcf5ced8344f0ad00e0d",
      "translation": "“强化”，就是让我们使用的武器变得更强的技术。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5b3716ae771b7dd9e8c3559d3a2d63a187ab7e76cc5679e2d11d0cf0b4a8847c",
      "source_sha256": "e5d14d5894105f5c7f28a97ccba093c6b79910881d15acef778f49c922f02d88",
      "translation": "大多数武器都有“卡蒙德盘”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:939549fb92f023cfcc6e6a617b6644d1174ee3c72c70c16be0e0b00ba524e5e7",
      "source_sha256": "627dcdda49c45b11777e5c371d821fb6bc8de22c6254163c0d477525aed09239",
      "translation": "盘上有用来镶嵌卡蒙德的“插孔”。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4886ffea13e069bee86693b7e83597965feae2c5a57a647dab593acaff0d504a",
      "source_sha256": "370a6dc15b4075f1dde4ff9612a8fce72624704fcb78d263b2f2ea90511e4f32",
      "translation": "把卡蒙德嵌入插孔，就能提升武器的能力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b96ff5c0cd4d9e56edd2c8a44a52eba2530dc6c9025743a5cc8a35ff0ec2bf0c",
      "source_sha256": "a10bf0683a89f8a96032e686af6a9f48658ec9d34caba3e5206463e3e56ef5ac",
      "translation": "这就是强化的基本原理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c87b9db1807926dac9f437422e1ad16a21204674eb62145269814d0decccfb79",
      "source_sha256": "aa89ac3a2df729d5115b785300a0607026737139abc780d0a5b3f2c9a671b5ae",
      "translation": "只要装上卡蒙德，武器就会变强吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0664552eace14487e2217bd62b2c0b7f1f3d2cc76060d684bb10cc0d3cd18a12",
      "source_sha256": "caf7647db72d64dfc6e64c06bdae18bcd1bf724af54e6d6da48088a7d46f7ed9",
      "translation": "嗯。将卡蒙德嵌入卡蒙德盘的插孔后，就会产生新的盘面，让卡蒙德盘扩展开来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2e62b4b4060c8ae581553efce3bf447a4000fad8c3e17115b3e8acb62934c02d",
      "source_sha256": "64288673a0d8ddf2fd2a319e0c2bbe49d36b6a48f5e596731a43f30f04b512cc",
      "translation": "武器的卡蒙德盘越多，插孔也越多，所以也越有利于强化。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9c773e7e854f2d631ab2c5744e47a65f4b1ff3ab720e70bd7083a38a5bed7adf",
      "source_sha256": "085a2855db039b3e83ed6b4f479f92b301cfc6907f4c6a765d1c2813550fe80f",
      "translation": "在哪里可以强化呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b600276293fae9627cbd8a379e89e5ad618e7aeab03281a99e421040db076aea",
      "source_sha256": "6fcbb1fc10296537bbfd4f347e74210c5944a4bb49e4a1dfc16a9b9940d4556d",
      "translation": "主菜单里有“强化”选项，在那里就能进行。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:05bd916be023666ed2f785ce74e087b679657fb89a937d26e539cc33e9168eb5",
      "source_sha256": "1d31da0fe2422797a3e8e713b38443fe29215b26b4d9118e491874ba8c5ccf19",
      "translation": "要强化，必须准备好带有卡蒙德盘的武器，以及卡蒙德。这两样缺一不可。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6178a46352d2ae6ec1f11c02f0e5c8361d03ac92ec2d55341c3598c028905984",
      "source_sha256": "080e3a3f174ae4ed3b5a8cdc93d20ab53be89882c3050a9ebb455535889c9035",
      "translation": "卡蒙德可以在城镇的“卡蒙德店”购买。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5563fce4219b9d49e24d04913d083cceafb5c0874d4e12500d65fa95ad623b42",
      "source_sha256": "8837eeb7cf44392aab54e1cf5b6c09aa2545944ae285f3509788a9a8df03fb7b",
      "translation": "不过，真正好的卡蒙德，大多都在怪物身上。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4f78f85f3afbbf70221b373406331aea7350e165743fb71fe0681267b10e43e6",
      "source_sha256": "a01e92f9b249d34da9a64328b40a3736c4db72bc667f59a2cb2e00f8fc1594d7",
      "translation": "怪物体内也藏着卡蒙德，所以与怪物战斗，就有机会获得。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4875ae3de72935d0283e2310271e9af4cc152ba283bb6bb66c8dc5222bbf8655",
      "source_sha256": "f060343876925ea36a4b53348a53914c20977748b593a7b1c7fa79b05b76d3dd",
      "translation": "另外，我的固有技里，有一招叫“精华提取”。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c6ba370532aefe9f438191f8b2ced53b1ce3ed30cd11a307ebcd18f1ac7f8e05",
      "source_sha256": "d6b94fa6ccd996f1fa13c1b10a1f286a874b1cb2a84c3c83fe4fd0cb206c861d",
      "translation": "使用精华提取，有时还能得到凝聚着怪物体内精华的特殊卡蒙德。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:686aa95080c32b2416fd5f163105d3cd25e518b43b1d89e3a1aaf5256e9dcc3c",
      "source_sha256": "6f9ec6728e90902189d4683beca6d44f9db39af7af78c336bc44b56f84216e17",
      "translation": "所以，也要好好利用我的固有技“精华提取”。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:42829acddd74e17e830f8be348e4173fe0d8e068dfceb494f63c27227b7528db",
      "source_sha256": "30c9153c38b3168e007f21ccbb93329f8da0777a3b94af225af5c49409fc08c2",
      "translation": "用这些卡蒙德强化武器，就能提高攻击力，让战斗更有利。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b4208bbbe88f5b9fabe98055a293d7a5e594a71fa0faf559b4e0a3c909e687b0",
      "source_sha256": "5fb0b769814e385ccbb4b1ce896e0b63f97afc1bc5df37f5c399cbac87fa0675",
      "translation": "以后得到新武器时，记得试试主菜单里的强化。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8493ca51736c21d90c4608bfe9b1373ba32cb2e12854967095269739191d89f0",
      "source_sha256": "467e43d7acf0109257e9ba30159ca787bcb3af022c5b6f409b309c968bb2f5e3",
      "translation": "我给你一些卡蒙德，亲手强化一次武器，应该就更容易明白了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:588fa238de3f44f2aef385328ec8694f696b640a8709fe72b2a35a4cfdec65b9",
      "source_sha256": "0a75fb04c42d53691585ef6dde6220ca39da9554f715720717a591250a1b762f",
      "translation": "好了，准备完毕后，就去阿巴泽特入口吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ec67d5f822b4aac8ab164f6ddc5956a3a67991e59759b20a6af25ecb37a5b2b1",
      "source_sha256": "bd1a4bb4245939156868314378e17a2438a27afc64e304c119421c0927dd7698",
      "translation": "和入口处的南部军士兵谈谈，就能搭乘卡尔玛，直接前往峡谷。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:08b640fbdb7d3a04a3c178187be2bd317aa3e1d7c7faa5d1ff7dd7122737a517",
      "source_sha256": "c9abb1186a4794d2794073c78de9940666635983a60d0197a3485d91eb1245d6",
      "translation": "<Styles:MC2_StyleFont_0>X<Styles:/> 我没听说过。\\n<Styles:MC2_StyleFont_0>Y<Styles:/> 嗯，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:46f282d14e1ad79d268edff5113af4f47596e86cc02bff1f404766533d2a29a6",
      "source_sha256": "44d5833d3ce65009cffd915c49a886bc0c17494a4e8f309e0e31f2e48e8b5895",
      "translation": "现在向各位传达此次攻略老狐峡谷的作战计划。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:932f9e2ca83a1172d72b78f5cb4d904a41f9ab02fc8e47934bf7ad13f84adec3",
      "source_sha256": "b63c8cc4b17adfd678b6b53188a1bbb9b5bf74d9642aa3a7ee073c18d36e4ec2",
      "translation": "第1阶段的攻击目标是恸哭之门。尽管我军曾多次进攻，这道门至今仍未被攻破。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:18717b7577d5ac25a0875d2277a0de6f42f023e6e9e55ebd1f73459c47a561d4",
      "source_sha256": "ff45f1f271b0ba035be2ed556a1536ea0f70fbc3531431e3c8318900a45a6175",
      "translation": "不过，经过反复交战，我们已经找到了有效的攻略方法。具体内容会通过库布传达。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d09aafbf44ef1f6c81ff2fdc9634342c7ad48944bfaafbaee7cb35b4d0b8f02",
      "source_sha256": "9cb92b17b3771ff0edd5afb0ddfea6cbe5e92bce198f87026b995f115aa3fe3f",
      "translation": "穿过恸哭之门后，希昂·雷格拉尔应该就在北部军的临时哨所。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5eba34f3fbff42273cd3e48b8228f08257adda9ccd877928a5d63aa498815111",
      "source_sha256": "d28f7566f360e4b1d6a2b535a4b833e40f676ded1812337e2013de42b83117ba",
      "translation": "那个人总会带着两名连环术师，保护自己。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:927a419a4a7cef82328f7b617f792f508fe42c970b51cedf7cb107c3b16da2ea",
      "source_sha256": "060b68c132404083aae1888002ed2f8668e864d1c5af5d13dfa8d14459095341",
      "translation": "据说，他会利用这些连环术师发动强力攻击，请务必小心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f2c78026a5fbf43223478c3b7578ae42dc7dbadfd2bcbc8da4acdb0c2dd3364d",
      "source_sha256": "05c8a5a957241a9cc0676bccf51d3e3cb6a18d2acf38e44e7b2cac3882a25052",
      "translation": "希昂·雷格拉尔所在的地方有一根晶柱。打倒他后，请在那里待命，我们会立刻将晶柱转换为我军所有。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7116c210764d3447aeb4d755e42bb7898e1f4f71864298843e7a1381ac12d76c",
      "source_sha256": "37f62e4ec69afacd9a265e6e18d8498f616c78cbdaae6727f4c2afe984814ec3",
      "translation": "那么，祝各位武运昌隆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:758a48812ce5f8e799d62979bfa491acc2cd66d4723322ab8a71a07d4ce17270",
      "source_sha256": "8049a0cc63157975f0236a51c8edf599524719c8a4812619c76ba70d005ae154",
      "translation": "临时哨所和敌军的晶柱，如今都已归我军控制。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:62d23c44cb18b2ad496c4ef190062524ae333d97afe6e4a468ec8586c5fa1d79",
      "source_sha256": "c923908de66eedb3afd76ce0a012a417ad905284fd6c2207d503b1c7bf9fb63f",
      "translation": "调查北部军的晶柱后发现，他们似乎已经接到了撤出老狐峡谷的命令。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:37e85f9ec010dc2ac0f5c1b6f1f94ac7735c131b3c125b28c5fd655ac5d55074",
      "source_sha256": "9f25a8c25481c0bbdc67546132d69997a4864d8af315d009d588f2a2280bd5b3",
      "translation": "连那座号称坚不可摧的恸哭之门都被破坏，看来他们的士气也受到了打击。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fa4b98b0b60c87442f5e5516e8079ac793f9ead837468a9448e1d5c75f0659ef",
      "source_sha256": "c6ca3c3ff98aca6e3157ad7c7b10f09f9381a5ed449539da801e777f7ca2fb3b",
      "translation": "对付正在撤退的敌人，应该不会有太大困难。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e411c7dc1cc72b192e2127883149e0da2dc56565caf952b32aa6ff170098daa9",
      "source_sha256": "646a5263370e79ad0708f51bde4d9aaa8d2275e86a30df577bf38be702c3bca5",
      "translation": "我们很快也会跟上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b40fbbd09314202a7fdffe5c3d010d96f3182d71be047d45d33c4d25ffd79cbb",
      "source_sha256": "d82e718405833b3cdeedfd141cfd1d5335741285538992685f09a5ae7f2833c8",
      "translation": "好，那就再痛痛快快地打一场。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:43532b67d0cc390c4e1ba39620f0b5194f3594bfea55a51bdf0d4cb06a858b24",
      "source_sha256": "516e68263af33af8a31d22a2a8ebc137b2642ca32836b4f54643f71fa2f6fbd2",
      "translation": "那是……克蕾尔？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:92988f675720192b0bd047a2ee3c14d74821e4978dcad92030de8537ed649139",
      "source_sha256": "e6e8367a315ef50863c72c5de9d60c5a78a1da6a7dbc93ce9262060c3c76cd7f",
      "translation": "好像是她。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4b8edbfbfe1729c25e92ecfda8deac62b7a10ff6725ecd0acd14536a988f0e5f",
      "source_sha256": "d5b8b8805734660c0b49f040ac26830612c5326b0fb4cf558936cda6f0605ed5",
      "translation": "克蕾尔？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6689bb6ef8db25da80b59495c7f15099413f0f85c3931b64c8877e1dae35fd83",
      "source_sha256": "d3d4bb676d2ace058ed7446bd84a265280cc772e571fe98eea46f67a6dd12211",
      "translation": "她是北部军总司令修恩扎伊特的心腹，需要格外警惕。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:03795e59f9a3b3fde703746037a140b30a05c2218efffa0f22e55c05ffa7051f",
      "source_sha256": "6ef34064e77e76cadd6f4e4e8eba04b3b9892b2f0abf6c741acc8e7251f47253",
      "translation": "大家小心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:12d3c28132de91a3e8d926294046b36b1ea07c08b8a693c70a32a116063ad80d",
      "source_sha256": "76331008668bf0f1e139543738525af44d2ecc1742a145d6c7ba9c4b71ee2830",
      "translation": "公主，您没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8ff32e08ba234276f3997fc0a5743416433cae3078ac05ca15f7647cd20627ad",
      "source_sha256": "6555182f11478bb6b9f28b19a3390cb9ab47122d582e494cd988d1023ab9d67c",
      "translation": "是北部军——！他们的援军来了！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:25d54c78ee5ba1adb443bb2113ebca4b754c29d33485ee8f44a478c8b1625d3e",
      "source_sha256": "385c8d5d13a31cd382ad1fcd43847ac2d2f60e10aabbd5dd400fd560a907ca8f",
      "translation": "那道墙……原来如此，克蕾尔是为了孤立我们，才故意现身的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:358407cd8c62918abd8b60100671473c822109ce7e4936606f16b04cdd547f5c",
      "source_sha256": "710d1d6992493c7e1b0059080134360175656f60308c7025b54678683ef1b7dc",
      "translation": "可恶……是陷阱吗！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bf89fe639054dc61adf31b9a8b8f87f8f135d69d4cc172be514ad2366cd65149",
      "source_sha256": "10a9d0bc3e8a494bd58b2da606090280c47e07d3b2b77cc23b79a2d99553468b",
      "translation": "公主，我们做到了！我们打倒哨兵了！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0c5d71dc353e0c282bbf45e067628f161c26196a8b6a32698bbad6d2d17b5b9a",
      "source_sha256": "4a4582cc2db4d798c1901003147e0b9511385b87d3454b9b8489ef5cddda94b6",
      "translation": "但我们还没有夺回峡谷……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:65af34e02f188bd1dd0bd4f9a1b42cf7480304d2660b606a3d081595f79cbaf8",
      "source_sha256": "4706e8f24e2cce4173b2a360d3620d5d747788215a48e7156f7aa4411da693f5",
      "translation": "可不管怎么说，至少打倒了哨兵啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c5d8ba9fe03c5c5c9b5e218f9d92a06d44d4a7e2ab55d52ac2c17211514fdeb9",
      "source_sha256": "3eafcb96d51b7f1ccf580f87c7b908bced43cb1b049acb74c273fb6072e89430",
      "translation": "有什么话，之后再说。既然北部军援军已经出现，继续留在这里太危险。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d70ea0a82477fd3cf22f9b8572d73a05b0fcd4a6dd762eda74f3d02100e7fa91",
      "source_sha256": "6fdac1068e306ea84adeccbd9dccfeed3e34eeb688c63d85d2e215db2542a2e0",
      "translation": "是啊，那道墙恐怕破坏不了。虽然也担心劳德他们……可我们已经没有回头的路了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:78ebd778f3d4fe1b0c04560aac6528ccbc1a4b30851c7518b2f5b9a9e6f79b58",
      "source_sha256": "d95a4933c6097c9bd05aa28dad9d7770434f64e925ed4d1438c4ad1311714dee",
      "translation": "可恶，退路居然被堵住了。明明都快赢了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fb74740ca5e8f0af001d68491b072a7e0b20848bbfb7f646b9a9a44c92838b67",
      "source_sha256": "d90f779cb2d7083d973c78e348a66880738a3a174d9ea96d80584a914287d125",
      "translation": "先去“柯塔马雷”吧。现在没时间留在这里商议对策。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:930e20f0f9e03ed95e5e0afbcf9b067d5de5308a7a6dd8956c8b6ddb093c46ca",
      "source_sha256": "82ade4d44fd8f330c85b82b1638421a545f639884f2be169766035c46c8c5104",
      "translation": "柯塔马雷？可马雷族不是讨厌人类吗？说不定会攻击我们。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:edfb11d2d8eb0804272ed622a9fa75a30d0c17a935af65a14cd82bd348702457",
      "source_sha256": "5aa564467513df4c3996d8f694bb8a3e1a729a36fe3fed5c398f0806e94a655c",
      "translation": "也不能一概而论。我倒觉得，不如趁这个机会，说服马雷族与我们结盟。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:308d01f3d4b828c639e92623e05ee025271aea10e2c74075846320fa9d43f9b1",
      "source_sha256": "fb57a78ad21c78e3f6dd8f9d7d0e15b641a7df09d493cd995e01de2d46ee1a73",
      "translation": "结盟？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b42ed4576f0e48c58c5e365561e0bd765d188ff29b3a1eeed065fdd702085c7f",
      "source_sha256": "8501f132094cc6e4a7e87bc382839ebea317c6056e9dbfb75bad26b3a2f773f6",
      "translation": "反正峡谷迟早要夺回来。之后，还得穿过柯塔马雷，向杜南丘陵进军。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d6a8efd1b613a76cd7bca979eb0b32b4e79cd83e19b2c884ddb238d55d272820",
      "source_sha256": "597b409a28c80c26b91645ef256c2a715c018fe6cef204914a317200d07611b4",
      "translation": "所以，如果能与马雷族结盟，杜南丘陵之战就会有利得多。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ac09f39da13c0ffb0bddcd7c4a48adb117ed53c3a15c5f5dfd5b9a2a1afe50f6",
      "source_sha256": "a335a8e9982fa7b7aaaab2636e103618f6db9b95c061adf5329e7a502c088ca1",
      "translation": "那就抓紧吧，摆脱追兵才是当务之急。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1ffe6d8b51c596f456c98e746b6cc6b78341c233fd9b91b8dc85efd0520c7c5b",
      "source_sha256": "ab7ef57e1422c27134fe33183698617c5f1e8b08ab86a634a4cd02e1c224cf15",
      "translation": "嗯，那就先去水色湿地。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3c10692d73cf9864ab64c6ce0fd53cae0ca3f9454c73b3fed83a335b61a140d3",
      "source_sha256": "688b0b0a7d3384883b44034835bfa8c69ebbfe5443d499160fb53697cc219134",
      "translation": "我经历了真正的战争。那是一个无比空虚的世界。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:983ee1a69a3b114b63d9d514382eac72a60ab725271f00e36bf4767c546903f1",
      "source_sha256": "76a6fea49d3ed58c509229b5286421ce347f15d131e085cde51e1648f3105751",
      "translation": "那里没有正义，人们只是为了活下去而杀戮。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7f01e48d4920a1e3447d75b16cd2150efb9c1c2538c3c2ce8e52c63c1cc8a354",
      "source_sha256": "3443ac27493831a6af4e63e09e435bd9a7d1b160f1a4c7b846a80464fc3138fc",
      "translation": "洁菲究竟怀着怎样的决心，投身这场战争？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b2700f46321c54976aedbecedf45cdd90d49ad25210cde91fddd694e64b88855",
      "source_sha256": "489bb7176290d1d4a52d4fa20a309ead99b93964f160786f84e1306b6c4c69aa",
      "translation": "看着同伴一个个死去，她又是什么心情？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eb5dcb0c5d356edb1d03f4f4b0ad3a19950d0fd54239e35f6bf67accd99a0c62",
      "source_sha256": "bffca9b9c98e32fc7287709b44564430e2566fa782198af49b19c6414ab40f39",
      "translation": "她曾在南部军士兵的遗物前默哀。直到此刻，我才觉得自己似乎懂了她当时的心情……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c7986d1781c3b0a3b1fd93ca4c5c774183baf23c6a7765a1f589b121d5a48152",
      "source_sha256": "751bbebcc8b63cbd9e3c68194f22fd0a6719780c69aa04cd28b2d0caf6c6ecea",
      "translation": "谢谢惠顾～欢迎下次再来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6f06d915fe834401a28014570e5df386fd6998569e070e0619ed4562760010de",
      "source_sha256": "b7b4d625fdd33b8bf836f3456989d6798879ed7f8f8fe7160394f83fc00a54a7",
      "translation": "这里是公会联盟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0ee2de30d0f52ab14935431d12aa7152a528c56962745023a612853f0d3a1f6b",
      "source_sha256": "f89b7b3540d4cbb9b661b686a02f9bdd3c0aee0798529bf966f2e0f382118dee",
      "translation": "果然，买东西前还是得列好清单。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:03b0ff7c79b697f7bc34b3f2bc5a925002620ad105fe4ff629825df7678dc1be",
      "source_sha256": "d5a7c176931050daac8fe13b9008c60223411069d382e92bcedafeec86373cc5",
      "translation": "明明有很多东西要买，到了这里却想不起来。唉，这记性。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1ccbad6ffaa5a872dc0d9cee2f579b59b8c69e85630b5a61516c21cbcaeb3959",
      "source_sha256": "d7e8e7a6424386da427ef4722e528a9b91e5455f3eb3edd251a1a19d92da947b",
      "translation": "嗯……要和公会联盟做生意，卖些什么好呢？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:90ce231691f027cf5b6bed204f4d6fcdd8d5cd0e51ac80f8426bce0a51e19fdc",
      "source_sha256": "978676af8a727ac7cefd73a0e1762fbdbbb7e5fbf263dc20b3e3c0a34f6aecd7",
      "translation": "我和女儿一起来的，让她帮忙整理一下货物，转眼就不知道跑哪儿去了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9331d6413c9ba684045a160c7c930f7e28b881e98e873c4b629ece8acfc3297a",
      "source_sha256": "c1336c9ae94c89c7a271a3d098010fdacc49eb3e4288523d3a32b50478810712",
      "translation": "本来还得一起整理货物呢。真是的，现在的年轻人……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c83899fa82d75c4d99316c61dec5311c4d4e0f999d7d3d7df8f45d926a95a900",
      "source_sha256": "ee47eee8bcfa09dcab9cc29cf26ac9c74bfc2bd45150ba1d4238c98c2177fa52",
      "translation": "如今这种世道，武器当然必不可少吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9777055b52bff810a521593c09cc6690ce0110ab5a4ebc6c3b64041a0fa1b883",
      "source_sha256": "3496bb1c9690e0272152e48716d2b40a97667f48c52d4f1417c12b52e6c143f8",
      "translation": "嗯……什么武器适合我呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f2986c19c3876f0aabc3541f25a01dd5ae2af2257eff9a3d4e59f758774d8da2",
      "source_sha256": "4d98c45c8f5588bed6cf6346d23b0fd55f6f16163f771b0190a62cff796441af",
      "translation": "这么多东西，光是看看，不也很开心吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:55a3f08b0c3718c59b5adfea3ff43a4d93c5eb8169941a60512865931a059dbd",
      "source_sha256": "3ba0734d6d72caada0d447b893f1a969f3e2538a5fa04108bc325531ac7d3c14",
      "translation": "谁敢在这里闹事，我绝不容忍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ec347a9e28b7be2e0e9a1023cd480e807030b8cabd0d365e26876e8404186112",
      "source_sha256": "4a028d4112945d3f3ca2fb02efb25346516276d1be1b7a5e426655cb10a9d20c",
      "translation": "把卡蒙德与卡蒙德合成，就能制作饰品。这就叫饰品加工。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2f55eab7fa5b744a84d6a2b5a010b3ba91f723a5e782793a6601c694ca8b99e7",
      "source_sha256": "f809a75650bcf8bdb66012b468855ce05feb2dbc3f9a0a98616e9e1bda10a064",
      "translation": "听说有配方的话，就能在卡蒙德店制作。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:32348f979a94318db563b53e7480acc57b6de57ed65cdea41b2d04327c5fe344",
      "source_sha256": "3b0a39e32e2d1130b3db85fee65041c915c8f25a7d73de043741c721670a3378",
      "translation": "嗯……即便在阿巴泽特，也买不到我们阿维斯用的机械零件啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b22fc1a4cab0b35efb81a189226eaae62f0f306596a64da415c916c126e4215b",
      "source_sha256": "0fd36cdeca1a850779e43cbe7482d8bea7aa78b247a55fdeff5a544683766464",
      "translation": "啊，我们阿维斯很擅长操作机械，嘻嘻呵！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7c59d1f7e54158ce787e16f81b5e2b68e59fb328a6ce74283d7ef46390faf669",
      "source_sha256": "2d323f4b44956c0aa830a3156e0d5ca8d0b157c778ff78901ee4380034388c37",
      "translation": "啊，这里可真有不少好看的东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2683ffc55a633da083ce5cd0878481aaf19c64b6ba5663787ee7dece36a79755",
      "source_sha256": "2b0856092010231531e39de7f355f4e6598f60061667342dc1ff9f5816cb16f7",
      "translation": "虽然有点对不起还在下面整理货物的爸爸，嘿嘿。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca0177ddf7df2fe150052739b7c4c8abf95e3fb885d4cee6ca97bc7e9aa95a73",
      "source_sha256": "a26cc7f6db8b5d73324e99a1bfc5e33846bf7141c4319c625e89b92bc480fc6b",
      "translation": "只要有亚历克斯大人在，南部军就不会输！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:457224bd0e30ba83ba6bf1f4ad2a99c25671bf4a7fb70135c53e37370d0b72ba",
      "source_sha256": "bd6c927f2bff24f0e00a085cbd62eae52499bab3725e2005bd5740f8d35e6074",
      "translation": "听说这次作战，劳德大人也会参战。有他亲自出马，这场仗就跟赢了没两样。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:aa0e458195dac6d1968d92d4ccf2aeffbdba60978dc8746b977c18f7610a2b3b",
      "source_sha256": "542b185418ecd51ac288f26268e6802255eea4d645d97147d0ed31687bb3acac",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特的部下里，克蕾尔、修亚伦和艾尔加，都是非常可怕的人物。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:03fdb9534521d03bfd7fcb01b8273344149aad25feaff99ba92db5064e900705",
      "source_sha256": "1abea9c38b9d7021baaf4730504bcf13b04f69cc6d70219db8cb38496a40aefd",
      "translation": "营救人质"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:73d6aebb7800655f9c4b18178a57615d3bfb1ccab5f35a79b6a2ba1ac4110369",
      "source_sha256": "ec133f609e6cf6950f4ae5b0f6863111cb13e85cd20790d921edfa8b73c4e3f7",
      "translation": "前往盗匪据点，营救在[卡蒙德采掘场]被绑走的\\n人质\\n\\n狼人的武器威力很强，利用朱特的固有技[反击]\\n破坏武器，可以让战斗更有利\\n成功救出后，可前往阿巴泽特的[公会联盟]总部\\n领取奖励"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:42538735fc0df239c8d133288b576e03360664f3ee22fa81efc82ed6b08e9c74",
      "source_sha256": "856ff8e75e3c0b850011819bfefad60d0ce9e199d56b07f52be89ff51cb447ac",
      "translation": "你们是南部军吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5d3d733854fd3564dc60bacc691168fd2164a9c5e4300647aa43da143c116ad2",
      "source_sha256": "be1299a7efa400f336caf4237440f9c706afb66cd34ea0e23e380655c2535dfd",
      "translation": "最近，盗匪闹事，我们已经多次请求援助。虽然来得晚了些，但总算是来了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cbb84afd7a7ca3d2d487eda06e6ab52244696309c1b4763f51dc4d127f5973b4",
      "source_sha256": "9d48bb437a335ca6f57a53ecdda8aaf8243b106dbd6e01e6679e20443b02b590",
      "translation": "问题有很多，不过，其他的都可以先放一边，唯独这件事，希望你们务必解决。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d75c49ad64d632ecb5fa3c3697d827def60a4f271e8c2cae64d0ee48dbcfa4ec",
      "source_sha256": "5b59b28d244b801999912827660e4a0836725d71850273e8f7744847e1d663b3",
      "translation": "我们的同伴被盗匪绑架了，恐怕被带去了西边某处的据点。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f238c7aa5f7f1cf776009c5da4029f74f241083126d7e39c4ff6fc46cf580829",
      "source_sha256": "992ecab8a200ca5f9aa0826635012104cfbf94a39f73b3549c05ae4e9853e245",
      "translation": "请把他救出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8782eb2175862326e65205847a4010f4118baa62e9793e87b1e93de2efbb8d2c",
      "source_sha256": "3b85b97d2be53e8d8dd9ead561a38fc7f87260b8090047005b588202c8dbb992",
      "translation": "要小心狼人的武器，威力很强。能破坏的话，最好先把武器破坏掉。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7d81da0b0985cbce6b261d476659ae663e6cc4d4e73a8708143ee2bddb3db794",
      "source_sha256": "153392699b1831399f2a19aa8f7f041e2aa21bb5c8c3dc31ec4c876f5e525ff3",
      "translation": "运气好的话，可以用反击来破坏。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:86e343694d6586d163d9dca8fb6329e04e083f978ab0741e5cd81846e2661676",
      "source_sha256": "4e0685a7ce3da3014e6e96828b9903669cef4e23974b6e96471117f99659b493",
      "translation": "除了他们的据点在西边附近，详细情况我们也不清楚。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fea3991e457949203053f66eaee90532c148ae1e0ec931cff7d915a05879f824",
      "source_sha256": "3fe0ff3b573d6dab0a27726b4fbc1fc466ea9dbcbc160a05f47b2b10eb3a4971",
      "translation": "抱歉，帮不上太多忙。可还是拜托你们，一定要把人救出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6068bca9cbc66d23cddd14a6126875cdd64d2088366fc0d54b2b3827bd61c4af",
      "source_sha256": "60bfd68d115d127dee94ef24d2ff8329edc5271affb6f205b2c294d299a4d210",
      "translation": "公会联盟一定会报答你们，我保证。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9e051f9f77b1822bc5a4dd923886b49c8a41ba083812aba7bea45c5ba85fa84d",
      "source_sha256": "d8d1cf0959e2500de52195a7c4d702dbd348e4bfaef7db5a0b4b874ed42df862",
      "translation": "什么？你们不是接到我们的请求才来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:36f4aa36d6354bce126772762ddea6a80854faacef266b122d1f186c5f64f796",
      "source_sha256": "a6d1a35b315c7c3c4d8a36ce4e9789a7d474a3840540f8abdc349e99573dee06",
      "translation": "啧，南部军到底还要无视我们公会联盟多久！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:815eea1d49353795e5d2320c15cd67590ce41cd25a05a86b57c907ac4f79cf40",
      "source_sha256": "d3d044ea3899e2bee604374b4bedce57c97e5621aadaeaca54b22dafaf24d462",
      "translation": "记住，再这么下去，你们也可能会吃亏！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dc8d6464ed62e408d4d89f76f0827b5f23332700d045ddd7264b5a5d4b8b0521",
      "source_sha256": "a93b60920aa29e9f7f54f3d5820c7ac8c29ffc54dfddc6d5435c0fde28ff40d5",
      "translation": "除了他们的据点在西边附近，详细情况我们也不清楚。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:17b5d139dbb0848637d5cec08b91e9fe0398ca563a3d3e8e72efb58c6697e89f",
      "source_sha256": "71ecad67970c6a455c602ab59b226950ce2b3e38cc5f0835e35b4522e81ff15b",
      "translation": "抱歉，帮不上太多忙。可还是拜托你们，一定要把人救出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6c7ca2f7532488ddc6aee630681bc177185f6d5c7ad9b54d33f600529bb600aa",
      "source_sha256": "60bfd68d115d127dee94ef24d2ff8329edc5271affb6f205b2c294d299a4d210",
      "translation": "公会联盟一定会报答你们，我保证。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
