      "translation": "谢……谢……谢谢你们。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d638f9f27387323729b2074f4e57826c6c1d59bc9e55a27c329a2aeba05f5277",
      "source_sha256": "e22b91e59e793965b056c47009fbbcfcce31a5469f8fc9eba121e8cf4f47c9d1",
      "translation": "我还以为，自己一定会死在这群野蛮的家伙手里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
